                                                "text": "after Nilus invndation,\n Infinite shapes of creatures men do fynd,\n Informed in the mud, on which the Sunne hath shynd."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "344bb558-1a73-3fdb-803a-a3b68955bceb",
                                        "entry_id": "fb45f43d-a82b-319c-b6cc-53c5807b3f68",
                                        "glosses": [
