                                                "sense_id": "344bb558-1a73-3fdb-803a-a3b68955bceb",
                                                "text": "But, mindfull still of your first countries sight,\n Doe still preserve your first informed grace,\nWhose shadow yet shynes in your beauteous face"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5dff46c-4b0c-3575-9348-89cd0ebfc23e",
